# ============================================================================
#  Default-deny publication policy.
#
#  Nothing in this repository is tracked unless it is explicitly allowed below,
#  so datasets, caches, decoded waveforms, trained weights and run logs can never
#  be committed by accident.
#
#  MIMIC-IV-ECG is credentialed data under the PhysioNet Data Use Agreement and
#  must never be redistributed, not even in derived per-record form.
# ============================================================================

# 1) ignore everything at the repository root
/*

# 2) project metadata, licences, citation, environment
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/LICENSE-FIGURES
!/NOTICE
!/CITATION.cff
!/requirements.txt
!/environment.yml
!/pytest.ini
!/train.py

# 3) source-code directories
!/models/
!/data/
!/experiments/
!/tests/
!/figures/

# 4) global excludes, defence in depth: no data, caches, weights or build output
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
*.log
*.csv
*.tsv
*.parquet
*.feather
*.npy
*.npz
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pkl
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.keras
*.dat
*.hea
*.atr
*.mat
*.rda
*.pdf
*.html
*.zip
*.gz
*.tar
.env
.env.*
*.key
credentials*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ============================================================================
#  5) aggregated results the paper is built from
#
#  AUCs, confidence intervals, P values and cohort counts per finding and per
#  analysis arm. They contain no waveforms and no patient records, and they let
#  anyone redraw every figure without access to the credentialed data. The one
#  per-record file is the handheld one: out-of-fold probabilities for the openly
#  licensed PhysioNet/CinC 2017 recordings, keyed by their public record names.
# ============================================================================
!/experiments/stats/
/experiments/stats/*
!/experiments/stats/*.csv
!/experiments/stats/handheld_oof_fixfs.npz

# ============================================================================
#  6) the figures of the paper and the scripts that draw them
# ============================================================================
/figures/*
!/figures/*.py
!/figures/*.png
!/figures/fig1_overview.pdf
